# ==========================================
# Unity DocSnap
#
# This repository is a Unity PACKAGE, not a Unity project:
# there is no Assets/ or ProjectSettings/ here, and the
# folders Unity generates only appear when the package is
# opened inside a test project. They are listed anyway,
# because that is exactly how they get committed by
# accident.
#
# The .meta files are deliberately NOT ignored. Unity
# resolves every asset by the GUID inside its .meta, so a
# package that ships without them hands each user a
# freshly generated GUID and every cross-reference rots -
# which the author never sees, because their own copy has
# the originals.
# ==========================================

# --- Unity generated ---
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/
[Ll]ogs/
[Uu]serSettings/
[Mm]emoryCaptures/
[Rr]ecordings/
sysinfo.txt
crashlytics-build.properties

# --- This tool's own output, when the package is being
#     tested inside a project that lives here ---
UnityDocSnap_Output/

